      "content": "a large, short-winged hawk (OED s.v. goshawk) | goshawk, a large, short-winged hawk (OED s.v. goshawk) | goshawk is a large, short-winged hawk (OED s.v. goshawk); rama is copper wire, so some sort of snare for goshawks is a conceivable meaning for the term. However, since the following words are completely illegible, this could easily be wrong"
